# Azure DevOps config for the change-request skill.
# Copy this to config.env and fill in your org's real values.
# config.env is git-ignored (see .gitignore) - kept local, never committed.
#
# AZDO_PAT is NOT set here. It's personal (tied to your ADO identity) and
# must stay in your own shell profile (~/.zshrc), never in this file.
#
# The `:=` form only fills in a variable if it isn't already set, so anyone
# who needs to override a value locally can still do so via their own shell
# without editing this file.

: "${AZDO_ORG:=your-org}"
: "${AZDO_PROJECT:=YourProject}"
: "${AZDO_CR_WORK_ITEM_TYPE:=Production Change Request}"
